"2, but we will call out step 2 explicitly later.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we add VQD's cost function. Note that compared to the previous lesson, "
"we now have two additional arguments (`realbackend` and `backend`) to help "
"us with transpilation when we use real backends.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
