#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Change betas {#change-betas}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As mentioned in the previous lesson, the values of $\\vec{\\beta}$ should be"
" bigger than the difference between eigenvalues. Let us see what happens "
"when they do not satisfy that condition with $\\hat{O}_2$\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\hat{O}_2 = 2 II - 3 XX + 2 YY - 4 ZZ\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "with eigenvalues\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This time, the optimizer returns the same state $|\\phi_0\\rangle = "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle + |11\\rangle)$ as a proposed solution to "
